/* Embeds icon.ico into isonic.exe as resource ID 1 - this is what gives the
   .exe its own icon in Explorer, the taskbar (including pinned, before the
   app is even running), and Alt-Tab. main.c also loads this exact same
   resource at runtime (LoadImageW + WM_SETICON) for the live window's
   titlebar/taskbar icon, so one file covers both instead of needing a
   second copy in some other format. */
1 ICON "icon.ico"
